t-analysis","line":40}],"metadata":{"title":"Security artifact exclusion and inclusion","description":"The lists of supporting artifacts assigned to a case can sometimes get long and there may be instances where you want to remove particular artifacts from a list. Rather than permanently remove the artifacts, you can exclude them from the list and, as needed, return them to the list at a later time.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/security-management/artifact-inclusion-exclusion.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":1,"breadcrumb":["Security artifact analysis","Security Case Management","Threat Intelligence","Enterprise security case management applications","Security Operations"],"tags":["#security-management","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/security-management/artifact-inclusion-exclusion.md"},
